blocking_enabled":null,"checklist_item":"","cohort":null,"criteria":["P6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":null,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["4 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable).","verify command `grep -qi 'arm64' docs/local-dev-env.md && grep -qi 'pandoc' docs/local-dev-env.md` greps the unanchored word 'arm64' — it substring-matches (e.g. 'review_arm64'); anchor it (\\b, ^$, or a quoted key like '\"arm64\":')","verify command `grep -cE 'importorskip|skipif' tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_wiki_render.py` inspects output with `grep` but asserts nothing — add an exit-code or comparison (-q, [ \"$(...)\" -eq N ], jq -e) so a failure is observable"],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Split compound criteria, replace subjective terms with observable outcomes, and state how each is verified.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":0.6,"blocking_enabled":true,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Weigh documenting PYPANDOC_PANDOC pointed at the verified arm64 pandoc as the primary selection mechanism (vs. relying on PATH ordering), since the plan already acknowledges it overrides the whole search and it removes the version-drift/PATH-ambiguity risk.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.6,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Plan: 'An explicit PYPANDOC_PANDOC environment variable overrides the whole search.'","Plan: 'The work is to make that system pandoc a stated, verified requirement ... rather than an accident of whatever a developer happens to have installed.'"],"finding":"The plan does not consider the PYPANDOC_PANDOC environment variable as the PRIMARY selection mechanism, on